Would play this over PUBG, mainly because my computer cant run PUBG.
Most people compare the 2 games, but based on personal experience H1Z1 is the better one for me.
EDIT:
By "I can't run PUBG" I meant that I can't run it at high quality.
Although the concepts of the games are the same, there are a few reasons why I prefer H1,
1. The vehicles are overall better in most aspects;
2. Loot is easier to spot since it gets highlighted;
3. More fast-paced and chaotic;
4. Weapon, helmet, and armor skins;
5. Better case and leveling system;
6. Ranking system;
7. Hitmarkers;
8. Overall a more polished game.
The places where PUBG is better than H1 are as following:
1. Better character movement;
2. Parachuting system;
3. Gun attatchments;
4. Minimap,
5. Weather,
6. More weapon choices,
7. Boats instead of driving through rivers;
8. More than 1 sniper rifle per game,
9. Consistent updates (Early Access).
